<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0702_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Tim &amp; Sue</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0702_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">So, how ’bout we swap\nnumbers?{YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0702_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hit us if you think of anythin’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0702_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Uh, OK. That’s too bad...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0702_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You decide you wanna\nswap numbers? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0702_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Uh-huh? Where you callin’ from?\rIf you right nearby, you might as well\ncome over and talk in person, ya know?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0702_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This Sue!\rHow you been since we last talked?\fYou doin’ a good job trainin’ your\nhomies? We doin’ great!\r{STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} grindin’ hard.\rYou got a good homie too. After a\nwhile, you’ll see it become a\fsensational partner! Hee hee!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0702_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This Sue!\rHow you been since we last talked?\nYour homies winnin’ their scraps?\rWe doin’ great!\nWe even beat a wild {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}.\rYou got a good homie too.\nAll you need now is a great partner...\fYou know what I mean? Hee hee!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0702_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This Sue!\rHow you been feelin’ since our\nlast talk? I got lotsa homies... Ah!\rWassup? This Tim!\nLemme talk on the phone... Wah!\rAnyway, he let a wild {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}\nget away recently!\rHe say the weirdest stuff\nsometimes. He said he couldn’t compare\fhomies with me, but... Ah!\rWassup! This Tim!\nShe deadass... Wah!\rYeah, that’s just how it is, ain’t it!\nI’ll leave it at that. We’ll call you\fagain later. Bye-bye!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0702_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, you wanna scrap us again?\rSound good?\rWe waitin’ on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}.\nSee you there!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0702_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, you forget our promise?\rI’m here with Tim, so I ain’t gettin’\ntoo bored, but still...\rWe waitin’ on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0},\nso please hurry.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0702_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, this Sue!\nI’m so, so, SO bored right now.\rTim stepped out, but he should\nbe back soon. That reminds me!\rWe recently saw a REAL fly guy.\rHe was wearin’ a purple tuxedo and a\nred bowtie. It looked FIRE on him.\rOh--my boyfriend back!\nTalk to you later!</language>
	</row>
</body>
